{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/putrijayamediateam/KPOne/pulls/1150","id":5512157604,"node_id":"PR_kwDOT-JFc88AAAABSIzZpA","html_url":"https://github.com/putrijayamediateam/KPOne/pull/1150","diff_url":"https://github.com/putrijayamediateam/KPOne/pull/1150.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/putrijayamediateam/KPOne/pull/1150.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/putrijayamediateam/KPOne/issues/1150","number":1150,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Draft: STK-46 retrospective valuation and report notices","user":{"login":"putrijayamediateam","id":292030783,"node_id":"U_kgDOEWgJPw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/292030783?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/putrijayamediateam","html_url":"https://github.com/putrijayamediateam","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/putrijayamediateam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/putrijayamediateam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/putrijayamediateam/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/putrijayamediateam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/putrijayamediateam/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/putrijayamediateam/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/putrijayamediateam/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/putrijayamediateam/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/putrijayamediateam/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Preserves the existing reviewed STK-46 slice for handover. This is a scoped draft; no merge or production deployment is authorized. Stacked on `feature/stk-46-design-continue`; it requires that dependency before main integration. Validation below is carried from the exact reviewed source artifacts, not a new exact-commit CI claim. Current-main integration and aggregate validation remain pending; PermissionCatalogue/TEAM overlap STK50/51 and other approved work.\n\n# STK-46 retrospective valuation and report notices\n\nStatus: implementation, independent Billing source review, focused checks, production build/types and live synthetic visual/download checks complete. Designer independently reviewed all four notice screenshots at 390/1440 px in light/dark; no bounded visual blocker.\n\nThis overlay applies to main 23639679e plus the approved service patch `fe79e7816b881dcdc2a7cefcbe6329b4e6cb90e97472a0b8a47723a60fcc520b`. It adds no migration, permission or existing-test assertion change. Exact overlay: `/workspace/inventory-review/stk46-replay.patch` (source hashes in `stk46-replay/source-manifest.json`). The approved inventory_hand_costs table must exist before deploying the reader.\n\n## Behavior\n\nThe latest accepted cost (decision time, then ID) replaces an eligible opening's missing cost or a purchase receipt's missing/estimated cost at its original movement date. Waiting/rejected entries have no effect. Actual costs remain authoritative. A zero accepted total is a known zero cost, not missing. History is replayed from the start; acceptance after the requested reporting period still restates that period.\n\nAccepted history remains in replay after a subsequent receipt correction. Reversal uses the existing average-cost policy: 10 units at RM10 plus 10 received with accepted RM20/unit gives 20 units at RM15; reversing 10 leaves 10 units worth RM150, not RM100. The provenance remains on that residual.\n\nProvenance follows averages, outflows, direct transfers and partial in-transit arrivals. A depleted costed pool clears current-position provenance; historical movements retain their consumed provenance. The existing result shape and figures are unchanged when no accepted cost contributes.\n\nStock value data and monthly journal opening/closing figures include scoped Changed on notices. Notices also cover a current-period supplier credit referring to an earlier return movement. The journal CSV includes the notices as metadata, preserving existing columns and balancing rules. The page shows a conditional, quiet information block below the existing accounting banner, per independent designer sketch. Private hand-cost notes, references and checker identities are not included.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- Pure WAC old+new: 11 tests / 380 assertions, pass.\n- Focused Feature old+new: 29 tests / 353 assertions, pass. Includes historical closing and following opening restatement, accepted replacement tie-break, ignored waiting/rejected, unchanged ledger, CSV notice/privacy, actual receipt correction retaining accepted history, branch/transit/outflow notice scope and timezone.\n- Scoped PHPStan: zero errors.\n- Billing independent source review: no blocker; no source edits or test reruns by reviewer.\n- Designer supplied layout sketch before UI change and independently reviewed the notice (bounded review; no blocker).\n- Frontend vue-tsc, production build, file ESLint/Prettier and focused existing frontend checks pass.\n- Live synthetic preview 3038: four screenshots at 1440/390 light/dark, HTTP200, exact viewport scroll widths, zero JS errors. Actual journal download button produces HTTP200 CSV with both Changed on notices. Evidence in `stk46-replay/visual/`.\n- Own preview migration/seed and synthetic fixture pass; effective DB verified 127.0.0.1:55439/kpone_stk46_replay_preview_test before HTTP. Initial router cwd error and fixture role-branch mismatch were corrected in preview harness only; no source change needed.\n- No full backend suite run in this slice; coordinator owns shared full gate.\n\nEntry/checking UI is a later slice. No commits, push, PR, merge or production changes made.\n\n\nPublication update: owner authorized commit/push/draft publication on26 November2026. Historical statements above saying no commit/PR describe the pre-publication validation. No additional implementation or existing assertion changes were made during this preservation.\n","created_at":"2026-11-26T14:48:12Z","updated_at":"2026-11-26T14:48:12Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/putrijayamediateam/KPOne/pulls/1150/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/putrijayamediateam/KPOne/pulls/1150/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/putrijayamediateam/KPOne/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/putrijayamediateam/KPOne/issues/1150/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/putrijayamediateam/KPOne/statuses/ccf0fa91d2143970c2f0b658964d746a7758c886","head":{"label":"putrijayamediateam:feature/stk-46-replay-publication","ref":"feature/stk-46-replay-publication","sha":"ccf0fa91d2143970c2f0b658964d746a7758c886","user":{"login":"putrijayamediateam","id":292030783,"node_id":"U_kgDOEWgJPw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/292030783?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/putrijayamediateam","html_url":"https://github.com/putrijayamediateam","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/putrijayamediateam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/putrijayamediateam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/putrijayamediateam/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/putrijayamediateam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/putrijayamediateam/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/putrijayamediateam/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/putrijayamediateam/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/putrijayamediateam/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/putrijayamediateam/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":1340228979,"